{"seq":1,"slug":"batch-recall-trace-target","title":"按批次/序列号精准召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-product-authenticity-traceability/recall-bonded-link/batch-recall-trace-target","wordCount":2793,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"按批次-序列号精准召回\">按批次/序列号精准召回</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前面所有章节建立的东西——标识、链路、验真、举报——最终都要在一次召回里兑现价值。一批货出问题，平台需要回答三个问题：<strong>哪些商品受影响</strong>（范围）、<strong>它们现在在哪</strong>（在库、在途、已售）、<strong>怎么触达</strong>（下架、拦截、通知买家）。这三个问题分别对应集合运算、状态查询与动作执行，而它们的精度上限全部由前面的标识粒度与链路完整度决定。</p>\n<p>召回的技术核心是一个容易被低估的事实：<strong>「按批次召回」和「按序列号召回」不是同一件事的粗细版本，而是两种不同的集合运算</strong>。批次召回的输入是一个批号，输出是所有挂在该批号下的追溯单元；序列号召回的输入是一组具体单元，输出是它们的并集——后者可能横跨多个批次（例如「这 50 件在运输中受损」）。把两者用同一段代码实现，会导致序列号召回被错误地放大到批次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"召回范围的集合模型\">召回范围的集合模型</h2><p>召回范围的计算可以精确地表达为几个集合的交并运算。定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>：召回定义集合（由召回事件给出，可能是批号、序列号列表、时间窗、渠道）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>：已售出单元集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>：在仓/在途单元集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>：已终止（退货、销毁、已召回）单元集合</li>\n</ul>\n<p>那么实际需要处置的集合是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∖</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = (U \\cap S) \\cup (U \\cap W) \\setminus T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，即「受影响的、且尚未终止流转的单元」。这个式子看起来平凡，但它的每个部分都对应一个真实的工程问题：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\cap S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 需要<strong>把历史订单反向索引到追溯单元</strong>。这是整条链上最容易在出事时才发现的缺失——订单表记录的是 SKU 与数量，不是序列号。如果出库环节没有做单元级绑定（见 <a href=\"../chain-node-capture/cross-border-node-event\">海外仓/干线/清关/国内段节点事件</a> 中第 4 段的映射难题），那么这个交集根本算不出来，召回只能退化成「下架该 SKU」。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\cap W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 需要<strong>库存的实时或准实时视图</strong>。在库商品可以直接冻结，在途商品需要通知承运商拦截——后者的成功率与响应时间都远差于前者，且必须尽早执行。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∖</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\setminus T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∖</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 需要<strong>终止状态的准确记录</strong>。已退货、已销毁的单元不应再收到召回通知；重复通知会显著降低用户对平台通知的信任。</p>\n<p>这三个交集各自的可行性与精度，由下面这张「信息完备度」表决定——它也是评估一个溯源系统召回能力的直接依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>已具备的信息</th>\n<th>可算出的集合</th>\n<th>召回精度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元级出库绑定 + 库存视图</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\cap S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\cap W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 都精确</td>\n<td>单品级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅出库绑定、无实时库存</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\cap S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 精确，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\cap W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 靠入库记录估算</td>\n<td>已售精确、在库近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅订单 SKU 推断绑定</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\cap S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 到订单级</td>\n<td>订单级，可能包含未受影响单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无绑定</td>\n<td>两者都不可算</td>\n<td>只能整体下架</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[召回事件定义] --&gt; B{定义粒度}&#10;  B --&gt;|批号| C[按批次展开为单元集合 U]&#10;  B --&gt;|序列号列表| D[直接得到 U]&#10;  B --&gt;|时间窗/渠道| E[先查出候选单元集]&#10;  C --&gt; F[U ∩ S 已售]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  C --&gt; G[U ∩ W 在仓/在途]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; H[排除终止状态 T]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[生成召回清单]&#10;  I --&gt; J[冻结库存]&#10;  I --&gt; K[拦截在途]&#10;  I --&gt; L[通知买家]\">graph TD\n  A[召回事件定义] --&gt; B{定义粒度}\n  B --&gt;|批号| C[按批次展开为单元集合 U]\n  B --&gt;|序列号列表| D[直接得到 U]\n  B --&gt;|时间窗/渠道| E[先查出候选单元集]\n  C --&gt; F[U ∩ S 已售]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  C --&gt; G[U ∩ W 在仓/在途]\n  D --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; H[排除终止状态 T]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[生成召回清单]\n  I --&gt; J[冻结库存]\n  I --&gt; K[拦截在途]\n  I --&gt; L[通知买家]</pre><h3 id=\"时间窗召回是隐蔽的坑\">时间窗召回是隐蔽的坑</h3><p>上面第三种定义粒度——「按时间窗召回」——在实践中出现得比想象中频繁：某条产线在 9 月 10 日到 12 日之间工艺异常，涉及该期间生产的所有批次。这类召回无法用批号表达（批号可能横跨异常期），只能用生产时间窗。它的实现依赖批次数据里的 <code>produced_at</code>（见 <a href=\"../chain-node-capture/brand-origin-attestation\">品牌源头背书与生产批次</a>），而这个字段恰恰是最常缺失或不可信的——品牌方提供的批次数据里，生产日期可能只到月份。</p>\n<p>因此范围计算必须有<strong>明确的降级路径与告知</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可用信息</th>\n<th>可计算的召回精度</th>\n<th>必须告知的范围放大</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>序列号列表</td>\n<td>单品级</td>\n<td>无放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批号 + 单元级出库绑定</td>\n<td>批次内单品级</td>\n<td>无放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批号（无出库绑定）</td>\n<td>批次级，已售部分按订单反查 SKU</td>\n<td>可能放大到同 SKU 其他批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅 SKU + 时间窗</td>\n<td>SKU 级</td>\n<td>显著放大，需下架全部同 SKU 在售</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里的第三行是最常见的现实情况。它的含义是：<strong>即使标识粒度做到了序列号，只要出库环节没有绑定，召回精度仍然退化到批次</strong>。这也是为什么在前面几篇里反复强调第 4 段的单元级绑定——它是召回精度的实际决定因素，而不是标识设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"召回清单的生成与索引\">召回清单的生成与索引</h2><p>召回清单的生成要求是<strong>可审计、可复现、可分批执行</strong>。一次召回可能涉及十万个单元，清单必须落库而不是在内存里算完就丢。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE recall_campaign (&#10;  campaign_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  reason_code   VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,     -- quality_defect | regulatory_notice | counterfeit&#10;  scope_type    VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,     -- lot | serial_list | time_window | channel&#10;  scope_payload JSONB       NOT NULL,&#10;  opened_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  closed_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  status        VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;draft&#39;&#10;  -- draft | approved | executing | completed | cancelled&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE recall_target (&#10;  campaign_id  BIGINT      NOT NULL REFERENCES recall_campaign(campaign_id),&#10;  trace_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  disposition  VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,      -- in_stock | in_transit | sold | terminated&#10;  order_id     BIGINT,                    -- 已售单元对应的订单&#10;  notified_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  resolved_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  resolution   VARCHAR(16),               -- returned | refunded | confirmed_safe | unreachable&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (campaign_id, trace_id)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_recall_target_order ON recall_target (order_id) WHERE order_id IS NOT NULL;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_recall_target_pending ON recall_target (campaign_id) WHERE resolved_at IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recall_campaign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  campaign_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- quality_defect | regulatory_notice | counterfeit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- lot | serial_list | time_window | channel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_payload JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opened_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'draft'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- draft | approved | executing | completed | cancelled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recall_target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  campaign_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recall_campaign(campaign_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trace_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  disposition  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- in_stock | in_transit | sold | terminated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已售单元对应的订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  notified_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolved_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolution   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- returned | refunded | confirmed_safe | unreachable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (campaign_id, trace_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_recall_target_order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recall_target (order_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_recall_target_pending</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recall_target (campaign_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resolved_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>disposition</code> 与 <code>resolution</code> 分开，是因为一个单元的状态会流转（在途的变成已售的、已售的变成退货的），而处置动作是终态。把两者合成一个字段会导致状态机无法表达。</p>\n<h3 id=\"支撑反向索引的表设计\">支撑反向索引的表设计</h3><p>召回的核心查询是「给我这个批号下所有已售单元的订单」与「给我这个订单里所有受影响的单元」。前者需要 <code>(gtin, lot_no) -&gt; trace_id</code> 的索引，后者需要 <code>order_id -&gt; trace_id</code> 的索引。第二个索引的建立必须在<strong>出库时就完成</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE order_unit_binding (&#10;  order_id    BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  trace_id    BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  bound_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  bind_source VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- outbound_scan | order_sku_infer | manual&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (order_id, trace_id)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_binding_trace ON order_unit_binding (trace_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_unit_binding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trace_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bound_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bind_source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- outbound_scan | order_sku_infer | manual</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, trace_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_binding_trace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_unit_binding (trace_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>bind_source</code> 是一等公民，因为它决定了这个绑定能支撑什么精度的召回。<code>outbound_scan</code> 是出库时逐件扫描得到的真实绑定；<code>order_sku_infer</code> 是从订单的 SKU 与数量推断的，它只知道「这个订单买了两件该 SKU」，不知道具体是哪两件。用后者生成的召回清单，实际上仍然是批次级精度——但它比完全没绑定好，因为它至少能定位到订单。把这两种来源混在一起而不区分，会让召回精度看起来比实际高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从召回到通知的执行链\">从召回到通知的执行链</h2><p>范围算出来之后，动作有四个方向，它们的时限要求差异很大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>时限要求</th>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冻结库存</td>\n<td>在库单元立即下架</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>多仓库存视图不同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拦截在途</td>\n<td>未签收单元截回</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>承运商响应慢；已到末端无法截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知买家</td>\n<td>已售单元告知</td>\n<td>小时至天级</td>\n<td>触达率；用户不回应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上报监管</td>\n<td>合规报告</td>\n<td>按监管时限</td>\n<td>字段不全需补</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后两项有一个共同的难点：<strong>触达与回应</strong>。召回通知与营销消息在用户感知上是同类的，因此触达率低是常态。提高回应率的可行手段是让通知携带<strong>可验证的具体信息</strong>（哪个订单、哪件商品、批号），以及给出明确且低成本的动作（一键申请退货而不是让用户自己找客服）。这与验真页的设计原则一致：展示支撑动作的最小信息，给出明确下一步。</p>\n<p>召回的分类与表述有现成的监管参照。美国 FDA 的召回制度把召回分为三类（Class I/II/III，按健康危害程度递减），并把「召回」「更正」「移除」等概念在 21 CFR Part 7 中分别定义；针对食品的召回还专门给出了零售收货人清单的指南要求（<a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/industry-guidance-recalls\">FDA Recalls</a>）。这套分类在跨境场景下不能被直接照搬（平台不是监管机构，无权做 Class I/II/III 的定性），但它提供了一个有用的<strong>对内分级模板</strong>：不同级别的召回对应不同的通知强度与时限，而不是所有召回都走同一套流程。跨境的食品类商品还应关注欧盟 RASFF 这类快速预警机制的通报，它是基于欧盟《通用食品法》（Regulation (EC) No 178/2002）第 50 条建立的、成员方与委员会之间全天候交换食品安全信息的通道（<a href=\"https://food.ec.europa.eu/food-safety/rasff_en\">EU RASFF</a>）——一次境外通报可能直接触发平台的召回评估。</p>\n<h3 id=\"召回进度必须闭环\">召回进度必须闭环</h3><p>召回的&quot;完成&quot;不等于&quot;通知发出&quot;。一个成熟的召回视图必须能区分：已通知、已回应、已处理、无法触达。上面 <code>recall_target</code> 表的 <code>resolved_at</code> 与 <code>resolution</code> 就是为此设计的——<code>unreachable</code> 是一个合法且必须记录的终态，因为它有合规含义（监管需要知道有多少无法触达）。把无法触达的单元从分母里剔除，会让召回完成率虚高，这是审计中最容易被抓到的问题（见 <a href=\"trace-coverage-audit\">溯源覆盖率与监管审计</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"召回演练-平时就要建好的能力\">召回演练：平时就要建好的能力</h2><p>召回的索引与流程必须在平时就建好并<strong>定期演练</strong>，因为出事时现建是来不及的。演练的最小内容是：随机取一个批号，测量「从发出指令到算出完整召回清单」的耗时；随机取一个已签收订单，验证能否反查到具体追溯单元。</p>\n<p>这两个测量直接暴露前面所有章节的缺陷：如果反查不到单元，说明出库绑定缺失；如果清单耗时以小时计，说明索引缺失或数据分布在多个未联通的系统里。演练结果应当有记录的基线，且这个基线本身是 <a href=\"trace-coverage-audit\">溯源覆盖率与监管审计</a> 中系统能力评估的输入。</p>\n<p>一个常见的组织障碍是：演练需要品牌方、仓库、承运商配合，而这些协作关系在平时不存在。因此演习的范围应当先从平台可控的部分开始（库存冻结、订单反查），再逐步扩展到需要外部配合的部分（在途拦截）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>召回范围是集合运算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∖</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = (U \\cap S) \\cup (U \\cap W) \\setminus T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>；批号召回与序列号召回是两种不同的运算，不能共用实现。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\cap S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 依赖历史订单到追溯单元的反向索引，这个索引必须在出库时建立，否则召回精度退化到 SKU 级。</li>\n<li>时间窗召回依赖靠谱的生产日期字段，而它常只精确到月份；范围计算必须有明确降级路径并告知放大程度。</li>\n<li>召回精度由出库环节的单元级绑定决定，而不是由标识设计决定——序列号标识加上无绑定，精度仍等于批次。</li>\n<li><code>order_unit_binding.bind_source</code> 必须区分 <code>outbound_scan</code> 与 <code>order_sku_infer</code>，后者只支撑到订单级而非单元级。</li>\n<li>召回动作分四个方向（冻结库存、拦截在途、通知买家、上报监管），时限要求不同；通知的&quot;完成&quot;不等于&quot;已处理&quot;，<code>unreachable</code> 是必须记录且不可从分母剔除的终态。</li>\n<li>索引与流程必须平时建好并定期演练，演练的两个核心指标是清单生成耗时与订单反查成功率。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按批次/序列号精准召回","id":"按批次-序列号精准召回"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"召回范围的集合模型","id":"召回范围的集合模型"},{"level":3,"text":"时间窗召回是隐蔽的坑","id":"时间窗召回是隐蔽的坑"},{"level":2,"text":"召回清单的生成与索引","id":"召回清单的生成与索引"},{"level":3,"text":"支撑反向索引的表设计","id":"支撑反向索引的表设计"},{"level":2,"text":"从召回到通知的执行链","id":"从召回到通知的执行链"},{"level":3,"text":"召回进度必须闭环","id":"召回进度必须闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"召回演练：平时就要建好的能力","id":"召回演练-平时就要建好的能力"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可疑/伪造码举报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-product-authenticity-traceability/verify-scan-experience/fake-code-alert-report"},"next":{"title":"与三单/保税数据的衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-product-authenticity-traceability/recall-bonded-link/trace-customs-bonded-link"}}